OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers will
OL,6,Fgradually die away through this
OL,7,Fevening. Then the rest of the night
OL,8,Fwill be mainly dry with clear periods.
OL,9,FChilly in sheltered parts of Deeside.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FStarting off dry with some
OL,12,Fsunshine. Cloudier in the afternoon
OL,13,Fwith a few passing showers.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,16,Fdry over the weekend although the odd
OL,17,Fshower still possible in the north and
OL,18,Fwest. Rain likely to spread northeast
OL,19,Fon Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
